  "body": ">[!IMPORTANT]\r\n> dd-trace-java version [v1.69.0](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-java/releases/tag/v1.69.0)\r\n\r\n## What's changed\r\n✨ Resolve client IPs for Java Lambda AppSec events (https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-java/pull/13219 - @claponcet)\r\n\r\n## dd-trace-java layer ARN:\r\n\r\n### AWS Regions\r\n```\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:dd-trace-java:31\r\n```\r\n\r\n### AWS gov regions\r\n```\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:<AWS_GOV_REGION>:002406178527:layer:dd-trace-java:31\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-java/compare/v1.68.1...v1.69.0\r\n",
